You are working on a production-grade React application built with Vite, TailwindCSS, Redux Toolkit, and Axios.

Your goal is to build a MODERN, CLEAN, and VISUALLY APPEALING UI — not a boring CRUD interface.

========================
🎨 VISUAL DESIGN SYSTEM (UPGRADED)
========================

1. Color Usage (STRICT BUT BEAUTIFUL)
- Use Tailwind palette ONLY (no hex)
- Primary: indigo-600 (default), hover: indigo-700, active: indigo-800
- Secondary: sky-500 (soft actions)
- Success: green-600
- Danger: red-600
- Warning: amber-500
- Neutral: gray (use gray-50 / gray-100 backgrounds for depth)

👉 ADD VISUAL DEPTH:
- Use subtle backgrounds: bg-gray-50, bg-white
- Use borders: border-gray-200
- Use hover states everywhere
- Use soft shadows: shadow-sm / shadow-md (NOT heavy)

2. Buttons (IMPORTANT — MAKE UI POP)
- Primary Button:
  - bg-indigo-600 text-white hover:bg-indigo-700 active:bg-indigo-800
  - rounded-lg px-4 py-2 shadow-sm
- Secondary Button:
  - bg-white border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50
- Danger Button:
  - bg-red-600 text-white hover:bg-red-700
- Ghost Button:
  - text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-100

👉 Buttons MUST:
- Have hover + active states
- Have disabled styles (opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed)
- Use consistent padding and rounded-lg

3. Typography (CLEAN & MODERN)
- Font: Inter
- Headings:
  - h1: text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight
  - h2: text-xl font-semibold
- Body:
  - text-sm text-gray-600
- Labels:
  - text-sm font-medium text-gray-700

👉 Improve readability:
- Use spacing between sections (space-y-4 / space-y-6)
- Avoid dense UI

4. Layout & Spacing (MAKE IT PREMIUM)
- Page container:
  - max-w-7xl mx-auto p-4 md:p-6
- Use cards:
  - bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 p-4 md:p-6
- Use spacing:
  - gap-4 / gap-6 (NO random spacing)

👉 NEVER clutter UI

5. Header (STRICT — MODERN + RESPONSIVE)
- Sticky header: sticky top-0 z-50 bg-white border-b border-gray-200
- Layout:
  - Left: Logo / Title
  - Center (optional): Search
  - Right: Actions (profile, logout)

👉 Mobile:
- Collapse menu into icon
- Use flex + justify-between
- Ensure touch-friendly buttons

6. Responsiveness (VERY STRICT)
- Mobile-first ALWAYS
- Stack elements vertically on mobile
- Use:
  - grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3
- Buttons full-width on mobile when needed

👉 MUST ENSURE:
- No horizontal scroll
- Clean stacking
- Comfortable spacing

7. Forms (IMPORTANT UX)
- Inputs:
  - border-gray-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500
  - rounded-lg px-3 py-2
- Error:
  - text-red-500 text-xs mt-1
- Labels always visible

👉 Add:
- Disabled states
- Loading states

8. Micro-Interactions (MAKE IT FEEL ALIVE)
- Add transitions:
  - transition-all duration-200
- Hover effects:
  - hover:shadow-md
  - hover:bg-gray-50
- Button click feedback

